#. module: web_calendar_ergonomics
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:web_calendar_ergonomics.field_res_users__bf_calendar_highlight_clear
msgid ""
"When the marks go away. Each refresh replaces them by what changed since "
"that refresh, they can instead pile up for as long as the page is open, or a"
" click on an event can clear its own mark."
msgstr ""
"Quand les marques s'effacent. Chaque rafraîchissement les remplace par ce "
"qui a changé depuis, ou elles s'accumulent tant que la page reste ouverte, "
"ou encore un clic sur un événement efface la sienne."

